# Checklist discipline

- Read `AGENTS.md`, `Agents/TASKS.md`, `Agents/README.md` and relevant architecture decisions before work.
- Follow the authoritative full checklist and dependencies; choose an unfinished item and preserve existing marks and implementation.
- Complete the item's whole scope and acceptance gate with appropriate verification; partial scaffold work remains unchecked.
- After the required Graphify refresh, mark the completed item `[x]` and add dated evidence to `Agents/COMPLETION_LOG.md`.
- Keep deferred/blocked items `[ ]` with explicit notes. Maintain completion status only in `Agents/TASKS.md`.
- If required inputs or reference facts block work, stop and ask the user before proceeding with dependent implementation; do not assume a missing answer.
- Example: implementing signup screens does not complete Apple login until the signed provider flow and session tests also pass.
